l.cc//bauxita-2023","source":"tv12.lk21official.cc","synopsis":"People-pleasing cop Baby accepts a fake charge to get leave for her sister-in-law’s baby shower in Rewa. There, she reunites with her childhood friend Bansi, who is murdered that very night. Defying dismissive in-laws, an indifferent husband and an apathetic local police force, she secretly investigates the murder, uncovering family betrayals while finding her own voice, courage and place as a real cop.","backdrop":"https://live.metahub.space/background/medium/tt40915016/img","imdbId":"tt40915016","imdbRating":6.2},{"title":"Agreste","slug":"/agreste-2023","poster":"https://poster.assetsy.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/film-agreste-2023-lk21.jpg","rating":7,"year":2023,"episode":1,"season":1,"isComplete":false,"isSeries":false,"isMovie":true,"genres":["Drama, Romance"],"url":"https://tv12.lk21official.cc//agreste-2023","source":"tv12.lk21official.cc"},{"title":"The Lyricist Wannabe","slug":"/lyricist-wannabe-2023","poster":"https://poster.assetsy.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/film-lyricist-wannabe-2023-lk21.jpg","rating":6.7,"year":2023,"episode":1,"season":1,"isComplete":false,"isSeries":false,"isMovie":true,"genres":["Drama"],"url":"https://tv12.lk21official.cc//lyricist-wannabe-2023","source":"tv12.lk21official.cc"},{"title":"Tatsumi","slug":"/tatsumi-2023","poster":"https://poster.assetsy.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/film-tatsumi-2023-lk21.jpg","rating":6.1,"year":2023,"episode":1,"season":1,"isComplete":false,"isSeries":false,"isMovie":true,"genres":["Crime, Drama"],"url":"https://tv12.lk21official.cc//tatsumi-2023","source":"tv12.lk21official.cc"},{"title":"Maly: 7 Day Return","slug":"/maly-7-day-return-2023","poster":"https://poster.assetsy.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/film-maly-7-day-return-2023-lk21.jpg","rating":6,"year":2023,"episode":1,"season":1,"isComplete":false,"isSeries":false,"isMovie":true,"genres":["Horror, Mystery"],"url":"https://tv12.lk21official.cc//maly-7-day-return-2023","sour